<p><ul>
<h4>Direct access to online <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/" target="_blank">help</a>: <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/msa/InterPNT.htm" target="_blank"><font size="+2">InterPNT</font></a></h4>
<h4>Access the application from the menu: <i>"Tools | Terrain interpolation and analysis | Interpolation from point data, lidar"</i></h4>
</ul></p>
